# Q16). scripts/sync-fixtures.sh copies the valid examples (never the
# invalid/ ones) of each source into the directory named first, writes
# SHA256SUMS and docs/LAB_VERSION, and regenerates
# src/test/labExamples.generated.ts. Edit a commit here, then run it;
# never edit a copied file. scripts/check-fixtures.sh checks the
# checksums offline and, online, every file against its source at the
# pinned commit.
