# The lab mirrors uspace-lab/schemas/common/ and knowledge/vectors/. The
# per-system schemas are not mirrored by the lab yet (its
# schemas/<system>/SOURCE names no commit), so until they are, those
# examples come from the owning repository at a pinned commit (decision
# record M11); each moves to the lab's mirror when it is pinned there.
